  "review_notes": [
    "`SBLGNT.MAT.12.4.v002` is marked FALLBACK EXCLUDED BY EVIDENCE over s013 and s014, but the excluded base differs only in the form of tokens the projection still carries (`ἔφαγον`, `ὃ`), and every English word here has a source token to answer to, so rule 97 produces no `added` unit.",
    "Splitting `ἄρτους` and `προθέσεως` is impossible because the ASV writes one solid token; the alternative of heading the unit on `προθέσεως` was rejected under rule 17, *bread* being the compound's meaning-bearing noun."
